					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-4333703#post-4001112</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-4333703/scp-049-j#post-4001112</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 23 Sep 2018 21:14:35 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Magainita</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4660687</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is the funniest thing I've read in a while.<br /> I like SCP-049, especially with its updated story and I love satire, its personally one of my favorite types of comedy. Mix these two together and you get comedy gold. Well done author, I haven't had a good laugh like that in quite a while!</p> <p>Most Joke SCP's I've noticed are usually random for the sake of being random to seem like it's funny because of it. While it can be funny, some are just over the top.<br /> Taking a popular SCP, using it's flaws and go over top with that is perfect!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
