				<wikidot:authorName>SHTseltzer</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2627555</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>When you count objects, however, you use &quot;两&quot;, not &quot;二&quot;.</p> <p>For example, &quot;two people&quot; is &quot;两个人&quot;, not &quot;二个人&quot;. The context of the &quot;two&quot; here is that we are counting guards, so we would use &quot;两&quot; (I think?)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
